{
  "_comment": [
    "Translated names for entities that have NO BMW catalogue descriptor: the",
    "integration's own derived/diagnostic entities. Catalogue-backed entities get",
    "their names from catalogue.json (title_en / name_de / names_i18n) instead.",
    "",
    "Keys must match the entity's translation_key at runtime, and must not",
    "collide with any key derived from a descriptor (tests/test_catalogue.py",
    "enforces both). Edit here, then re-run tools/generate_translations.py.",
    "",
    "English strings must stay byte-identical to the names these entities had",
    "before they were moved into the translation pipeline, otherwise existing",
    "installs would see their entities renamed.",
    "",
    "\"states\" labels the states of these entities, per platform and key, the",
    "same way BMW's enum values are labeled (issue #300). A state Home Assistant",
    "should translate must be a lowercase slug."
  ],
